   {
    "text": "Chinese Quota Filled for September 2026 \n\nRare HDB with sea view (Very High Floor) \nSpacious 1,023 sqft 4-room\nHard-to-replicate location and view\nShort Drive to HarbourFront & VivoCity\n\nPositioned near the transformation of the Greater Southern Waterfront\nTOP 2011\n\nProperty Highlights\n\nSpacious 1,023 sqft layout\nVery high floor with panoramic sea views\nFunctional and efficient floor plan\nBright and airy living spaces\nIdeal for families and homeowners seeking a tranquil living environment\n\n**Excellent Connectivity**\n\n* Walking distance to Telok Blangah MRT Station (Circle Line)\n* Easy access to major expressways including AYE and CTE\n* Convenient commute to the CBD, HarbourFront, and One-North\n\n**Amenities at Your Doorstep**\n\n* Located right beside the neighbourhood wet market and hawker centre\n* Supermarkets, coffee shops, clinics, and daily conveniences within walking distance\n* Nearby schools, childcare centres, and community facilities\n\n**Nature & Lifestyle Attractions Nearby**\n\n* Minutes from the scenic Berlayer Creek Boardwalk, a beautiful coastal mangrove trail\n* Close to Labrador Nature Reserve for nature walks and outdoor activities\n* Enjoy refreshing morning walks around Reflections at Keppel Bay and the Keppel Bay waterfront\n* Near the iconic Henderson Waves, one of Singapore's most popular recreational destinations\n* Short drive to VivoCity for shopping, dining, entertainment, and access to Sentosa\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to own a home that combines convenience, connectivity, nature, and stunning sea views in one of Singapore's most desirable city-fringe locations.\n\n=============\nMarketing by Justin Zaw\n\n17 Years of Real Estate Experience\n\n16 × Top Producer Awards\n\n1 x $150K Platinum Producer (Single Month)\n\n4 × $100K Platinum Producer (Single Month)\n\n10 × $50K Elite Gold Champion (Single Month)\n\n11 × $10K Gold Champion (Single Month)\nContact\nJustin Zaw (R028197F)\nSenior Marketing Director – Huttons\n9*4*8*9 6*1*3*9",
